    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, then for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>det</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math> lies in the interval :"
